# Input

```yaml
short_sequence: [a, b,]
short_mapping: {a: 1,}
long_sequence: [first_value, second_value, third_value]
long_mapping: {first_key: first_value, second_key: second_value,}
nested: [[first_value, second_value], {key: value, other: value}]

```


# Options

```json
{
  "formatter": {
    "lineWidth": 30
  },
  "yaml": {
    "formatter": {
      "trailingCommas": "all"
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```yaml
short_sequence: [a, b]
short_mapping: { a: 1 }
long_sequence:
  [
    first_value,
    second_value,
    third_value,
  ]
long_mapping:
  {
    first_key: first_value,
    second_key: second_value,
  }
nested:
  [
    [
      first_value,
      second_value,
    ],
    {
      key: value,
      other: value,
    },
  ]

```
